Third-party code in this repository
===================================

contracts/did/EthereumDIDRegistry.sol
  The ERC-1056 reference registry, unmodified in code, from
  https://github.com/uport-project/ethr-did-registry (contracts/EthereumDIDRegistry.sol,
  last changed upstream in commit 0ab4f151ddde5b7739b97827c4fb901289f57892).
  The file carries an SPDX MIT header; the upstream repository is licensed Apache-2.0.
  It is reproduced here byte for byte as compiled and deployed for the measurements
  (see scripts/verify_bytecode.js), so no provenance comment was added to the file.

contracts/did/EthereumDIDRegistryArbL2.sol
  The same registry with one change for the revision experiment: the history pointer
  stores ArbSys(address(100)).arbBlockNumber() instead of block.number. Deployable on
  Arbitrum chains only.

All other code: MIT (see LICENSE). Measurement data in data/: CC-BY-4.0 (see data/LICENSE).
